.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH voa-config-list 1  "voa-config-list " 
.SH "نام (NAME)"
voa\-config\-list \- List the origins of technology settings used by OSes and specific contexts.
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
\fBvoa config list\fR [\fB\-o\fR|\fB\-\-output\-format\fR] [\fB\-v\fR|\fB\-\-verbose\fR]... [\fB\-q\fR|\fB\-\-quiet\fR]... [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
List the origins of technology settings used by OSes and specific contexts.
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.TP
\fB\-o\fR, \fB\-\-output\-format\fR \fI<OUTPUT_FORMAT>\fR [default: text]
The output format to use.
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
json: The JSON output format
.IP \(bu 2
text: The default text output format
.RE
.RS
May also be specified with the \fBVOA_CONFIG_LIST_OUTPUT_FORMAT\fR environment variable. 
.RE
.TP
\fB\-v\fR, \fB\-\-verbose\fR
Increase logging verbosity
.TP
\fB\-q\fR, \fB\-\-quiet\fR
Decrease logging verbosity
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help (see a summary with \*(Aq\-h\*(Aq)
